---
import CTASection from './CTASection.astro';
import OperationalProof from './OperationalProof.astro';
import { pricingExamples } from '../data/conversion';
const components = [
  ['Employee cost', 'The employee’s salary and relevant employment costs, based on the role, candidate expectations and agreed employment arrangements.'],
  ['iHire service', 'Recruitment, candidate screening, employment administration, payroll administration and agreed ongoing local support.'],
  ['Equipment', 'A laptop, monitor or monitors, headset and peripherals where the work requires them. The setup is agreed for the individual role.'],
  ['Connectivity', 'Internet connectivity and, where appropriate, backup connectivity to support the agreed working arrangements.'],
  ['Power resilience', 'A UPS or other backup power arrangements where required by the role and working environment.'],
  ['Role-specific requirements', 'Specialist hardware or additional infrastructure needed to perform the work. Requirements are confirmed during scoping.'],
];
const questions = [
 ['Are these fixed packages?', 'No. The prices shown are starting monthly amounts in New Zealand dollars, plus GST. Your final quote depends on the role, candidate experience, working hours and agreed setup.'],
 ['When will I know the cost?', 'We scope your brief, recruit and validate candidate expectations, then establish employment and infrastructure requirements. You receive an indicative quote to review before committing.'],
 ['Is equipment included?', 'Equipment, connectivity and backup power are agreed for the role. The quote identifies inclusions and any separate setup or infrastructure charges.'],
 ['Who manages the employee?', 'You manage daily work, priorities, training and performance. iHire handles the agreed recruitment and employment infrastructure.'],
];
---
<section class="section wrap compact-top pricing-examples" aria-labelledby="example-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="example-heading">From everyday support to senior expertise.</h2><p>Starting monthly prices in New Zealand dollars, plus GST.</p></div>
  <div class="pricing-grid">{pricingExamples.map((item) => <article class="pricing-example"><img class="pricing-image" src={item.image} alt={item.imageAlt} width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><h3>{item.title}</h3><p class="pricing-description">{item.description}</p><div class="price-guidance"><strong>{item.monthlyGuidance}</strong><span>per month + GST</span><span class="price-inclusions">All-inclusive: salary and management</span></div><p class="scenario-factors">{item.factors}</p><a class="button" href="/hire-talent/#enquiry">Get an Indicative Quote </a></article>)}</div>
  <p class="pricing-qualifier">Starting prices include salary and iHire management. Role examples show the kinds of work at each level; the scope and experience required determine the quote. Working hours, equipment, connectivity and any separate setup costs are agreed in your quote before you commit.</p>
</section>
<section class="section pricing-factors"><div class="wrap detail-grid"><div><h2>What shapes the final price?</h2><p>The person, the working arrangement and the setup they need.</p><a class="text-link" href="/hire-talent/#enquiry">Describe your requirements &rarr;</a></div><dl class="factor-list"><div><dt>The role</dt><dd>Responsibilities, skills, experience and candidate salary expectations.</dd></div><div><dt>The working day</dt><dd>Hours, headcount, sourcing location and coverage requirements.</dd></div><div><dt>The setup</dt><dd>Equipment, connectivity, power resilience and specialist infrastructure.</dd></div></dl></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What a quote may include.</h2><p>Clear inclusions and assumptions, with any separate setup costs identified.</p></div><div class="feature-grid quote-inclusions">{components.map(([name,body]) => <article><h3>{name}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section related-section"><div class="wrap"><h2>From requirement to a clear quote.</h2><ol class="quote-path"><li><h3>Describe the role</h3><p>Tell us the work, skills, hours and setup you need.</p></li><li><h3>We validate the scope</h3><p>We recruit, establish candidate expectations and confirm employment and infrastructure requirements.</p></li><li><h3>Review before committing</h3><p>Review the indicative quote and agree terms before an offer is made to your chosen candidate.</p></li></ol><OperationalProof/></div></section>
<section class="section wrap pricing-faq"><h2>Your pricing questions.</h2>{questions.map(([question,answer]) => <details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</section>
<CTASection mode="pricing"/>

<style>

.pricing-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:0 22px; }
.pricing-example { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); grid-template-rows:subgrid; grid-row:span 6; row-gap:0; position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding:0 0 26px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; background:var(--background); }
.pricing-example:nth-child(2) {box-shadow:0 12px 30px #20282b12}
.pricing-example:nth-child(2)::before {content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto;height:5px;background:var(--accent);z-index:1}
.pricing-image {width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.pricing-example h3 {font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1.25;margin:24px 24px 12px}
.pricing-example .pricing-description {font-size:1rem;margin:0 24px 20px;line-height:1.65}
.price-guidance {border-block:1px solid var(--border);padding-block:20px;margin:0 24px 20px}
.price-guidance strong {font-size:clamp(1.65rem,2.4vw,2rem);line-height:1.3;display:block;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.price-inclusions {font-weight:600;margin-top:12px}
.price-guidance span {display:block;font-size:1rem}
.pricing-example .scenario-factors {font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 24px 24px}
.pricing-example .button {padding:14px;gap:12px;font-size:1rem;justify-content:space-between;margin:0 24px;align-self:end}
@media(max-width:1000px) and (min-width:901px) {
 .pricing-grid{column-gap:14px}
 .pricing-example h3,.pricing-example .pricing-description,.price-guidance,.pricing-example .scenario-factors,.pricing-example .button{margin-inline:18px}
 .pricing-example .button{font-size:1rem}
}
@media(max-width:900px) {
 .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}
 .pricing-example{grid-row:auto;grid-template-rows:auto auto auto auto auto auto}
}

</style>
